Package: slurm-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: munge-ohpc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Slurm Workload Manager (OpenHPC)
 Slurm is a highly scalable cluster management and job scheduling system.
 This package contains the core Slurm binaries and libraries.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.

